383
00:32:07,572 --> 00:32:10,072
いっせーので死に至るまで踊れ
Ready, go, and dance until you drop!

384
00:32:18,572 --> 00:32:23,572
ワンツーまさかリ三四しっかり取り戻いんだってもういんだって
One, two, what do you know! Three, four, reap what you sow...

385
00:32:24,072 --> 00:32:28,572
ハッピーよ代わり gift me ときめき一斉のでさあ飛び込め
Happy replacement gift me, ready go and jump right in!

386
00:32:29,072 --> 00:32:34,072
本能ブギウギ混沌ぞくもりもいんだってもういんだっても
Instinct Boogie Woogie, chaos is in full swing...

387
00:32:34,072 --> 00:32:38,572
最低ヤスラロライカミステリー一斉のでぶっ飛ばせ
The lowest-tier Leica mystery, ready go and blow it all away!

388
00:32:39,072 --> 00:32:44,072
混沌ブギウギハッピー追加サービス出出しちゃえよ出しちゃえってほら！
Chaos Boogie Woogie, happy extra service, bring it out!

389
00:32:44,072 --> 00:32:49,072
だんだん落ちてく人生クソワロ一斉ので死ぬまで踊れ
Slowly falling apart in this crappy life, dance until you drop!

390
00:32:49,072 --> 00:32:54,072
もういいや全部全部ほら忘れ去ってしまおう
Forget it all, let's just leave it behind.

391
00:32:54,072 --> 00:33:00,072
簡単なことじゃないが我々ならできるだろうな
It's not easy, but people like us can do it.

392
00:33:01,072 --> 00:33:03,072
踊ろうぜ
Let's dance!

393
00:33:55,272 --> 00:33:58,272
頭でわかって嘆いた 転がしていく様子を嘲った
Knew it already, sighing at how things roll.

394
00:33:58,272 --> 00:34:01,872
寂しいとか愛とかわかんない 人間の形は投げ出したんだ
Don't know love or loneliness, I threw away human form.

395
00:34:02,072 --> 00:34:07,072
抱えきれない 言葉だらけの存在証明を
This proof of existence filled with words I can't hold.

396
00:34:08,072 --> 00:34:10,572
この小さな劇場から出られない 気づいたら最後逃げ出したい
Trapped in this small theater, wanting to escape before I notice.

397
00:34:10,572 --> 00:34:14,572
僕ら全員演じていたんだ エンドロールに向かっていくんださ
We were all just acting, heading toward the end roll.

398
00:34:15,072 --> 00:34:20,072
まあ皆必死に役を演じて 傍観者なんていないのさ
Everyone acts for their lives, there are no bystanders.

399
00:34:21,072 --> 00:34:24,072
ワタシなんてないの どこにだっていないよ
There is no "me," nowhere to be found.

400
00:34:24,072 --> 00:34:29,072
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
I could never become anyone at all.

401
00:34:30,072 --> 00:34:33,572
僕ら今ささ 喰らい合って 延長戦サレンダーして メーデー
Now we bite at each other, surrendering into overtime, Mayday!

402
00:34:34,072 --> 00:34:37,572
淡い愛想 垂れ流し 言の愛憎
Spilling shallow affection, words of love and hate.

403
00:34:38,072 --> 00:34:42,572
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろう
Hoping somewhere for a dramatic turn of events.

404
00:34:43,072 --> 00:34:46,572
君も YES YES 息を呑んで 采配はそこに有んだ ヘッドショット
You too, holding your breath, headshot where the command lies!

405
00:34:47,072 --> 00:34:53,072
騒ぐ想いも その心抉り抜いて さあ まだ見ぬ糸を引いて 黒幕のお出ましさ
Piercing through that heart, pulling unseen threads, here comes the mastermind!

406
00:34:53,072 --> 00:34:59,872
その目に映るのは
What reflects in those eyes...

407
00:35:06,131 --> 00:35:07,171
触れたら壊れてしまった
Touched, and it broke apart,

408
00:35:07,171 --> 00:35:08,311
間違ってく様子を黙った
and watched silently as things went wrong.

409
00:35:08,311 --> 00:35:10,171
僕ら全員無垢でありました
We were all completely innocent,

410
00:35:10,171 --> 00:35:12,851
いつのまにかやら怪物になったんだ
but before we knew it, we became monsters.

411
00:35:12,851 --> 00:35:17,851
その全てを肯定しないと前に進めないかい
Can we not move forward without affirming all of it?

412
00:35:19,348 --> 00:35:21,548
『まあ君にはきっと無理なんだ』
"Well, it's surely impossible for you,"

413
00:35:21,548 --> 00:35:25,678
いつのまにかやら外野にいたんだそんなガヤばっかり飛ばしてきたんだ
before we knew it, we were on the sidelines, just tossing noise around.

414
00:35:26,098 --> 00:35:31,628
皆必死に自分を守って救いの手を待ってるのさ
Everyone is desperately protecting themselves, waiting for a helping hand.

415
00:35:31,628 --> 00:35:34,958
考えたくはないよ馬鹿になっていたいも
I don't want to think, I just want to play the fool.

416
00:35:35,408 --> 00:35:40,408
ずっと僕は何者にもなれないで
I've always been unable to become anybody.

417
00:35:41,258 --> 00:35:42,428
だから今
So right now,

418
00:35:42,428 --> 00:35:43,548
前線上に立って
standing on the front line,

419
00:35:43,548 --> 00:35:45,298
その旗は高く舞って
that flag dances high,

420
00:35:45,298 --> 00:35:46,938
劣勢 頼る相棒
in an underdog plight, relying on a partner—

421
00:35:46,938 --> 00:35:48,898
言葉すらいらないよ
we don't even need words.

422
00:35:49,268 --> 00:35:53,948
ドラマチックな展開はどっとヒットしてんだろう
A dramatic turn of events must be hitting home,

423
00:35:53,948 --> 00:35:57,088
君も yes, yes 息を呑んで再会を誓い合って
you too, yes, yes, holding your breath, swearing to meet again,

424
00:35:57,088 --> 00:36:01,578
ワンチャンスしかないもっと一生懸命なのさ
giving our all for our one and only chance—

425
00:36:01,578 --> 00:36:06,898
クライマックスみたいな手に汗を握るのさ
gripping our hands in sweat like a climax.

426
00:36:08,078 --> 00:36:10,038
ぽつりと鳴いた
It cried out with a plop,

427
00:36:10,218 --> 00:36:13,638
隠してきた真実はどこにもない
The truth we've kept hidden is nowhere to be found,

428
00:36:13,638 --> 00:36:17,068
喋ってきた奴らに居場所はない
and those who spouted it have nowhere to belong.

429
00:36:17,068 --> 00:36:22,448
思い出してぽいってして感情はない流した涙理由なんてない
Tossed aside from memory, with no emotion—the tears we shed have no reason.

430
00:36:23,218 --> 00:36:26,388
優しさに温度も感じられない
We can't feel warmth in kindness,

431
00:36:26,388 --> 00:36:30,038
差し伸べた手に疑いしかない
and can only doubt the hand that is extended.

432
00:36:30,038 --> 00:36:32,818
穴が空いて愛は垂れてしまいたいなったんだ
A hole opened up and love spilled out,

433
00:36:32,818 --> 00:36:36,138
倒れそうな僕を吸い込んだんだ
swallowing up my collapsing self.

434
00:36:36,318 --> 00:36:42,808
諦めかけた人の前にアンタはいつも嘲笑うようにお出ましさ
Right before someone ready to give up, you always show up with a jeering smile.

435
00:36:42,808 --> 00:36:48,898
君にはどんな風に見えてるんだい呼吸を整えてさ
How does it look to you? Calm your breathing—

436
00:36:49,268 --> 00:36:54,098
ずっと僕は何者にもなれないで
I've always been unable to become anybody.

437
00:36:55,068 --> 00:36:58,138
僕ら今さっきさくらい合って
and right now, biting at each other in a battle of attrition,

438
00:36:58,138 --> 00:37:00,398
延長戦サレンダーしてメーデー
surrendering in overtime, Mayday!

439
00:37:00,398 --> 00:37:02,918
淡い愛想垂れ流し泥の愛憎
Spilling faint affability, muddy affection and hatred—

440
00:37:06,348 --> 00:37:07,888
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろう
expecting some dramatic turn of events somewhere.

441
00:37:07,888 --> 00:37:11,938
君も yes, yes 息を呑んで采配はそこにあんだ
You too, yes, yes, holding your breath, the orders are right there.

442
00:37:11,938 --> 00:37:16,298
ヘッドショットもう思いもその心撃ち抜いてさ
Headshot! Strike through those swirling thoughts and that heart right now—

443
00:37:16,298 --> 00:37:21,468
まだ見ぬ糸を引いて黒幕のお出ましさ
pulling unseen strings, the mastermind makes an appearance.

444
00:37:21,958 --> 00:37:26,098
“その目に映るのは”
"What reflects in those eyes—"

445
00:37:37,673 --> 00:37:41,463
都合の良い思いを燃やして
Burning up convenient thoughts,

446
00:37:41,463 --> 00:37:44,983
呆れた願いはもう手放した
I've already let go of this absurd wish.

447
00:37:45,163 --> 00:37:50,153
裏切りや秘密が漂ってここから動けない
Betrayal and secrets linger, and I can't move from here.

448
00:37:51,483 --> 00:37:54,333
生まれてしまった、あるいは壊れすぎてしまった
Born like this, or perhaps broken beyond repair,

449
00:37:54,333 --> 00:37:58,313
あの日あの場所でずっと、止まったままだった未来
that future remained stuck at that place on that day.

450
00:37:58,313 --> 00:38:02,123
それでも、心のどこかで君を感じていた
Even so, somewhere in my heart, I felt your presence.

451
00:38:02,123 --> 00:38:05,143
許せない、今の僕は誰？
Unforgivable—who am I right now?

452
00:38:06,433 --> 00:38:09,283
ねぇ、ずっとずっとそばにいたんだ
Hey, you were always, always by my side.

453
00:38:09,283 --> 00:38:12,193
「勘違いだ」って、嘘じゃないよ
It's no misunderstanding, that's no lie.

454
00:38:12,193 --> 00:38:18,573
望んだものではなくともあなたに出会えた痛みだけが愛だと信じられるように
Even if it wasn't what I hoped for, so I can believe that only the pain of meeting you is love—

455
00:38:18,573 --> 00:38:22,453
僕に触れないで！祈る、セレナーデ
don't touch me! I pray, serenading.

456
00:38:22,543 --> 00:38:25,373
僕なしでうまく幸せになってね
Be happily successful without me,

457
00:38:25,373 --> 00:38:29,013
誰よりずっと、何を手放しても
more than anyone, no matter what I let go of.

458
00:38:29,013 --> 00:38:34,683
これが愛だと信じていた、罰をください
I believed this was love—give me my punishment.

459
00:38:35,043 --> 00:38:38,203
誰でもない、あなた あなただけ
Nobody else, only you, just you.

460
00:38:38,203 --> 00:38:41,693
世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても
Even if the world still won't forget us,

461
00:38:41,693 --> 00:38:45,463
きっと、まだ あなた あなただけ
I'm sure, still you, only you.

462
00:38:45,463 --> 00:38:49,393
願い疲れても歌うよ、セレナーデ
Even tired of wishing, I'll sing, serenading.

463
00:38:51,793 --> 00:38:55,873
願い疲れても歌うよ、セレナーデ
Even tired of wishing, I'll sing, serenading.

464
00:38:57,613 --> 00:39:01,303
シナリオ通りのコメディ不幸自慢はハウメニー？
A comedy following the script, how many boast of misfortune?

465
00:39:01,303 --> 00:39:05,143
エゴイスティックに光った瞳の中に映っている
Reflected in eyes shining egoistically,

466
00:39:05,143 --> 00:39:09,633
「あなた」は「誰？」闇が光らせた舞台の上で
"'You' are 'who?' on the stage illuminated by darkness."

467
00:39:11,013 --> 00:39:14,973
希望も不幸も身勝手だ僕らは、全員共犯者だった
Both hope and misfortune are selfish; we were all accomplices.

468
00:39:14,973 --> 00:39:18,123
疑う余地もないほど
With no room left to doubt,

469
00:39:18,123 --> 00:39:21,953
運命が定まった、あの夜から僕は愛し方を忘れた
ever since that night when fate was sealed, I forgot how to love.

470
00:39:25,043 --> 00:39:28,053
これだけ願って、これだけ祈って
Wishing only this, praying only this,

471
00:39:28,053 --> 00:39:31,603
こんな、悲しい結末でごめんね
sorry for such a sad ending.

472
00:39:31,603 --> 00:39:35,353
すべて失って、すべて消え去っても
Even if I lose everything, even if everything vanishes,

473
00:39:35,353 --> 00:39:41,253
ただ、君がずっと生きていた痛みが欲しい
I just want the pain of you having lived on.

474
00:39:53,393 --> 00:39:59,733
あと何回数えたら、あと何回傷つけば
How many more times counted, how many more times hurt—

475
00:40:00,416 --> 00:40:01,396
光に包まれ
Wrapped in light,

476
00:40:01,396 --> 00:40:02,596
永い時間を過ごし
spending a long time,

477
00:40:02,596 --> 00:40:05,196
想い出す事も多くなったかな
I wonder if I've come to remember more things.

478
00:40:05,196 --> 00:40:07,596
このミライ あのミライも全て
This future, that future, all of them

479
00:40:07,596 --> 00:40:09,196
奮い起こされて
Roused up,

480
00:40:09,196 --> 00:40:10,596
今が動き出す
now things begin to move.

481
00:40:10,596 --> 00:40:12,796
新たなミライへと
Toward a new future.

482
00:40:12,796 --> 00:40:15,096
踏み出せば手を取った
If I stepped forward, you took my hand,

483
00:40:15,096 --> 00:40:17,596
まだ先は長いんだと
Wishing that the road ahead was still long,

484
00:40:17,596 --> 00:40:18,996
願ってくれた
You hoped for me.

485
00:40:18,996 --> 00:40:21,096
歩み続ける事
Continuing to walk,

486
00:40:21,096 --> 00:40:23,596
もう何回も もう何回も
many times, many times,

487
00:40:23,596 --> 00:40:26,096
重ね合わせた音は
the sounds we layered together

488
00:40:26,096 --> 00:40:29,096
読み込まずとも 深く焼き付いて
are deeply burned in without needing to load.

489
00:40:29,096 --> 00:40:30,996
記憶の片隅 既視感
A corner of memory, déjà vu,

490
00:40:30,996 --> 00:40:32,896
想いのシンクロニシティ
synchronicity of feelings.

491
00:40:32,896 --> 00:40:35,396
どのミライも離さないで
Don't let go of any future,

492
00:40:35,396 --> 00:40:37,496
今、始めよう
now, let's begin.

493
00:40:37,496 --> 00:40:40,096
慈しむ声が 優しいあの歌が
The affectionate voice, the gentle song,

494
00:40:40,096 --> 00:40:42,596
巡り巡って 愛は伝わってく
revolving and revolving, love is transmitted.

495
00:40:42,596 --> 00:40:45,096
感情線は走り出す
Emotional words start to run,

496
00:40:45,096 --> 00:40:47,796
追いかけていくから 追いかけさせるから
because I'll chase you, because I'll make you chase me,

497
00:40:47,796 --> 00:40:50,096
熱を帯びて 時を駆けて
taking on heat, running through time,

498
00:40:50,096 --> 00:40:53,696
君に届け 交わる今想いのMemory
